---
interface Props {
  class?: string;
}

const { class: className } = Astro.props;

const skills = ['Tech', 'AI', 'Marketing', 'Psychology', 'Web'];
---

<section class:list={['about-canvas', className]} aria-label="About Mazen Ragab">
  <div class="about-canvas__hero">
    <h1 class="about-canvas__title">
      <span class="about-canvas__title-line1">About</span>
      <span class="about-canvas__title-line2">Me!</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="about-canvas__name">
      Mazen Ragab aka <span class="about-canvas__alias">(Maztardoo)</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-canvas__bio">
    <p>
      Hi, you already know my name! I am currently a G12 student at New Cairo STEM School. Even
      though I am G12, I am 16 years old, which is kinda dope ngl cuz I feel superior lol.
    </p>
    <p>
      A fun fact about me is that I am trying to be a Polymath. I am into multiple stuff. I am into
      Tech, Marketing, Psychology and Human Behaviour, Business, and honestly a lot of other random
      things that I find interesting. I really enjoy learning about things outside of what I am
      supposed to know, especially when I can connect different fields together and use them to
      create something.
    </p>
    <p>
      I don't really want to limit myself to one specific field or career. I want to explore as much
      as I can, build things, understand people, learn how businesses work, and develop skills that
      complement each other. I think the most interesting ideas usually happen when you combine
      knowledge from completely different areas.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of academics, I am also really into building projects and experimenting with ideas. I
      enjoy taking an idea that sounds stupid at first and trying to turn it into something real. I
      am especially interested in AI, entrepreneurship, and using technology to solve actual
      problems.
    </p>
    <p>
      Overall, I would say I am just extremely curious. I like going down random rabbit holes,
      learning things that have absolutely nothing to do with school, and then somehow finding a way
      to connect them back to something useful. My goal is basically to become the type of person
      who can walk into almost any conversation and have something interesting to contribute.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-canvas__section" aria-labelledby="about-skills-title">
    <h2 class="about-canvas__section-title" id="about-skills-title">
      SKILLS
    </h2>
    <div class="about-canvas__badges" role="list" aria-label="Skills">
      {skills.map((skill) => (
        <span class="about-canvas__badge" role="listitem">
          {skill}
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-canvas__section" aria-labelledby="about-education-title">
    <h2 class="about-canvas__section-title" id="about-education-title">
      EDUCATION
    </h2>
    <p class="about-canvas__education">New Cairo STEM School (G12)</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-canvas {
    max-width: 48rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #1a1a1a);
    font-family: var(--font-body, system-ui, sans-serif);
  }

  .about-canvas__hero {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-canvas__title {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    font-family: var(--font-display, 'Dotemp-8bit', 'Courier New', monospace);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about-canvas__title-line1 {
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 11vw, 6.5rem);
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .about-canvas__title-line2 {
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 11vw, 6.5rem);
    color: var(--color-accent, #c02a2a);
    margin-left: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 5rem);
  }

  .about-canvas__name {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent, #a52a2a);
  }

  .about-canvas__alias {
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .about-canvas__bio {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #2b2b2b;
  }

  .about-canvas__bio p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-canvas__section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-canvas__section-title {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display, 'Dotemp-8bit', monospace);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
  }

  .about-canvas__badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .about-canvas__badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 4.5rem;
    min-height: 4.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: #f4f4f4;
    color: #111;
    border: 2px solid #1a1a1a;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000;
    font-family: var(--font-display, monospace);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-canvas__education {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #333;
  }
</style>
